  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「うひゃああ、降ってきたぁあ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「どっかに、雨宿りできるところは——あっ、あそこっ、ちょうどいいかも！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「おりゃあ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「ふうっ、すっごいどしゃ降り——あぁもう、制服びっちゃびちゃ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「天気予報は雨降るなんて言ってなかったじゃん……。へくちっ、風邪ひいちゃいそう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あ、こんにちは——たしか、こないだ抱きついちゃったひと……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あのときはごめんなさいっ、あなたも雨宿りですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あはは、何か恥ずかしいな——制服も透けちゃってるし、何であたしこう間が悪いんだろ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「え？　これ、くれるんですか？　そこの自販機で買った紙パックのコーヒー？　」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「うわぁい、ありがとうございます——先輩、ですよね？　」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「生まれて初めて優しい年上のひとに出会えたかも！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あたし、お兄ちゃんがいるんですけど、ほんと生活能力ぜんぜんないひとで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「部活の先輩も——こないだ見たかもしれませんけど、曲者としか呼びようがない性格してるんですよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「だから『あたしがしっかりしなきゃ』っていつもドタバタして、失敗ばっかりしちゃうんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「でも、そんなふうにあたしが気張る必要はなかったのかもって——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あたし、先輩に言われてラクロス部でもアタックに集中し始めたんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「もちろん前より敵に点を取られてボロボロになるんですけど、それ以上に得点できることも多くなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「勝ったり負けたり——でも、今のほうがずっと楽しいです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「早く部活の時間にならないかなって、いつもワクワクしちゃうぐらい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「だから風邪ひいて休みたくなかったし、あったかい飲み物くれて嬉しかったです——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「って、またストロー噛んじゃった。何かあたし、噛みつく癖があるみたいで。あっ、これ、お金払いますね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「え？　いいんですか、えへへ——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「先輩はほんとに何だか『雨宿り』って感じのひとですね、疲れてるときに休ませてくれるみたいな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あっ、雨あがった！　虹でてますよ虹！　」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「よぉし、ダッシュで帰って制服干しちゃお——それじゃっ、またどこかでお会いしましょう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「がんばるぞ〜！　あたしはラクロス部の星になる！」"
  }
]